### ==============================================================================
### Pegasus TCG Backend: Reorder & Batch Add-to-Cart Manual Testing (.http)
### ==============================================================================
### Test Data Seed Script: scripts/db/reorder_manual_test_seed.sql
### Environment Variables:
### - baseUrl: http://localhost:8080
### - buyerEmail: buyer@example.com
### - buyerPassword: Password123!
### - otherBuyerEmail: ton@example.com
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTHENTICATION: Sign In as Test Buyer (demo_buyer)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "buyer@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store the Bearer Token from login response
@buyerToken = {{loginBuyer.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1b. AUTHENTICATION: Sign In as Other Buyer (deckbuilder_ton)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name loginOtherBuyer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ton@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Store Other Buyer Token
@otherBuyerToken = {{loginOtherBuyer.response.body.data.tokens.accessToken}}


### ==============================================================================
### ENDPOINT 1: Reorder Preview (GET /api/v1/orders/{orderId}/reorder-preview)
### ==============================================================================

### [Positive] 1.1: Successfully retrieve Reorder Preview for completed order 9001
# Expected: 200 OK with seller orders, matching items, alternatives & vacation check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/9001/reorder-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### [Negative] 1.2: Order is NOT in COMPLETED stage (order 9002 is PENDING_PAYMENT)
# Expected: 400 Bad Request with "Only completed orders can be reordered"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/9002/reorder-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### [Negative] 1.3: Order belongs to ANOTHER buyer (order 9003 belongs to user 6)
# Expected: 404 Not Found (prevents order ID enumeration vulnerability)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/9003/reorder-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### [Negative] 1.4: Order ID does NOT exist
# Expected: 404 Not Found with ORDER_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/999999/reorder-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### [Negative] 1.5: Missing Authentication
# Expected: 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/9001/reorder-preview
Accept: application/json


### ==============================================================================
### ENDPOINT 2: Batch Add-to-Cart (POST /api/v1/cart/items/batch)
### ==============================================================================

### [Positive] 2.1: Successfully add batch items to cart (Listing 9301 qty 1, Listing 9302 qty 2)
# Expected: 200 OK with full updated cart response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "listingId": 9301,
    "quantity": 1
  },
  {
    "listingId": 9302,
    "quantity": 2
  }
]

### [Negative] 2.2: Atomic Rollback Test (1 valid listing 9301 + 1 out-of-stock listing 9304)
# Expected: 409 Conflict (LISTING_NOT_PURCHASABLE) with details: { "listingId": 9304 }.
# Verification: Neither item is added (the entire batch is rolled back).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "listingId": 9301,
    "quantity": 1
  },
  {
    "listingId": 9304,
    "quantity": 1
  }
]

### [Negative] 2.3: Seller on Vacation Test (Listing 6 belongs to seller on vacation)
# Expected: 409 Conflict (LISTING_NOT_PURCHASABLE) with details: { "listingId": 6 }
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "listingId": 6,
    "quantity": 1
  }
]

### [Negative] 2.4: Empty Batch List
# Expected: 400 Bad Request ("Batch size must be between 1 and 50")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[]

### [Negative] 2.5: Batch Size Exceeding Limit (> 50)
# Expected: 400 Bad Request ("Batch size must be between 1 and 50")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {"listingId": 9301, "quantity": 1}
]

### [Negative] 2.6: Missing Authentication
# Expected: 401 Unauthorized
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "listingId": 9301,
    "quantity": 1
  }
]
